#  THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Verified 2026-09-04.
#  The rules above already keep spreadsheets, archives and images out, which is most of the way
#  there. The working tree also collects business documents as MARKDOWN and JSON, and those were
#  not covered: EBITDA and balance-sheet audits, a QuickBooks consolidation, expense data and an
#  expense review, billing notes, a mailbox search dump, a client handover, a sourcing
#  comparison, a for-sale report, a pending trademark list.
#  None of it had ever been committed. But there were 1,283 untracked files in that worktree
#  against 100 tracked ones, so `git add -A` was one keystroke from publishing the company's
#  finances. Afterwards: 22, none of them private.
*_AUDIT_*.md
EBITDA_*.md
BS_AUDIT_*.md
QB_*.md
GRABO_*.md
HANDOVER-*.md
billing*.md
LV_STORAGE_OPTIONS_*.md
gmail-outbound-search.md
expenses_data.json
doba_*.json
td_pending.json
tm_list.json
charts/
gripster_shots/

#  Agent working state and a vendor binary distribution. Neither is source.
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
ExpansionHunter-*/
